The '''Malevolent Stages''' are group of special stages added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]]. They appear for 1 day per month and are unlocked after clearing [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku/Mount Fuji]] in [[The Aku Realms]]. Upon completing a Malevolent Stage, the player will be rewarded with the [[True Form]] of the [[:Category:Brainwashed Cats|Brainwashed unit]] corresponding to the unique "Malevolent" Cat that appeared as an enemy in the stage. All the Malevolent Cats are [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] and have the [[Counter-Surge]] ability.

==Schedule==
*3rd: [[Century's End (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cat]]
*6th: [[Demon Eraser (Merciless)|The Malevolent Tank]]
*9th: [[Hyperberserker (Merciless)|The Malevolent Axe]]
*12th: [[Devilish Strides (Merciless)|The Malevolent Gross]]
*15th: [[Ruthless Tyrant (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cow]]
*18th: [[Apocalypse (Merciless)|The Malevolent Bird]]
*21st: [[Adrift in Fear (Merciless)|The Malevolent Fish]]
*24th: [[Spitting Death (Merciless)|The Malevolent Lizard]]
*27th: [[Titanic Rampage (Merciless)|The Malevolent Titan]]

==Trivia==
*All the Malevolent Stages are Merciless in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], but are only Insane in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]]. This is likely a mistranslation in the same vein as the stages of [[NEO Wanwan's Glory]], as the Japanese names of the Merciless and Insane [[Stage Difficulties|difficulties]] are very similar. This was corrected in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], which properly labeled all the Malevolent Stages as Merciless in EN.
*The Malevolent Stages are currently the only [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]] for [[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha units]].
*In [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], all the Malevolent Stages' enemy bases had their HP increased to 2,500,000. Originally, they had 800,000 to 1,700,000 HP depending on the stage.

